    "created_at": "2016-03-29T07:26:59Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-03-29T07:26:59Z",
    "body": "I think if you take what you're talking about further you'll get some kind of alarm API that we never really got around to. I'm not entirely sure if such an API should be notification-driven or if it needs to be a lower-level primitive that awakes a service worker on schedule.\n",
