    "created_at": "2016-03-29T07:43:38Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-03-29T07:43:38Z",
    "body": "Yeah, I think doing this through a generic low-level \"wake up a SW on a\ngiven time\" API is the way to go.\n\nIn part because I suspect it'll be as common to want to call `openWindow`\nwhen the timer fires, as to create a notification.\n\n/ Jonas\n",
